xsimd
------------------------------------------
C++ wrappers for SIMD intrinsics and parallelized, optimized mathematical
functions.

Runtime requirements:
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  doctest-2.5.3-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  xtl-0.8.2-1bl1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/xtensor-stack/xsimd

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/xtensor-stack/xsimd/archive/refs/tags/14.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack xsimd-14.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./xsimd-14.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/xsimd-14.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/xsimd-14.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

